{
    "type": "game",
    "name": "Carsick Carventure",
    "steam_appid": 2658840,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2658840/extras/4937db1789f22445597dd19770f9e7bd.avif?t=1703239623\" width=616 height=100 /></span><br>You are about to play a student game made by a small but ambitious team. Releasing our first game on Steam is a dream come true! The game is crafted under the guidance of the developer of the Engine Evolution franchise, and we can't wait until you try it!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2658840/extras/83b8317b84d333368d484af9b5a5bddc.avif?t=1703239623\" width=616 height=100 /></span><br>In this Chrome Dinosaur inspired mode, you take a looong ride through an endless world as you dodge a wide range of foes and pull off epic flips to dominate the leaderboards. Do you have what it takes to set the all-time high score? <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2658840/extras/7a9ebe2d55f80dcd60762ab0c9f833c2.avif?t=1703239623\" width=616 height=100 /></span><br>Buckle up for a ride in stylish procedurally generated worlds. We went the extra mile and took a special course at the university to learn how to make them!<br><br><br>The game was created by Vladim\u00edr Ho\u0159k\u00fd (MFF UK), Jan Nekarda (MFF UK), S\u00e1ra Borovi\u010dkov\u00e1 (PedF UK). Published by Petr \u0160im\u016fnek (MFF UK)",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2658840/extras/4937db1789f22445597dd19770f9e7bd.avif?t=1703239623\" width=616 height=100 /></span><br>You are about to play a student game made by a small but ambitious team. Releasing our first game on Steam is a dream come true! The game is crafted under the guidance of the developer of the Engine Evolution franchise, and we can't wait until you try it!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2658840/extras/83b8317b84d333368d484af9b5a5bddc.avif?t=1703239623\" width=616 height=100 /></span><br>In this Chrome Dinosaur inspired mode, you take a looong ride through an endless world as you dodge a wide range of foes and pull off epic flips to dominate the leaderboards. Do you have what it takes to set the all-time high score? <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2658840/extras/7a9ebe2d55f80dcd60762ab0c9f833c2.avif?t=1703239623\" width=616 height=100 /></span><br>Buckle up for a ride in stylish procedurally generated worlds. We went the extra mile and took a special course at the university to learn how to make them!<br><br><br>The game was created by Vladim\u00edr Ho\u0159k\u00fd (MFF UK), Jan Nekarda (MFF UK), S\u00e1ra Borovi\u010dkov\u00e1 (PedF UK). Published by Petr \u0160im\u016fnek (MFF UK)",
    "short_description": "Carsick Carventure is a hyper-casual game where you drive your cute 2D car as far as possible. Discover new places, set new records, and beat your friends! Enjoy infinite levels and different game modes!",
    "supported_languages": "English",
